<EnglishPageLayout
  title="Comeback Traveler | Practical travel planning"
  description="Practical travel planning notes for Vietnam trips, travel gear, and staying connected abroad."
  alternatePath="/"
  alternateHref="/"
>
  <p class="en-eyebrow">Comeback Traveler</p>
  <h1>Travel planning, made more practical.</h1>
  <p class="en-lead">An English home for clear, experience-led planning notes. We are starting with the foundations: Vietnam trip preparation, travel gear, and connectivity.</p>

  <div class="en-grid">
    <a class="en-card" href="/en/vietnam-travel-prep">
      <p class="en-card-label">Plan</p>
      <h2>Vietnam travel prep</h2>
      <p>Build a calmer first itinerary with practical preparation notes and future English guide hubs.</p>
    </a>
    <a class="en-card" href="/en/travel-gear">
      <p class="en-card-label">Pack</p>
      <h2>Travel gear</h2>
      <p>A growing collection for useful travel essentials, without turning every item into a recommendation.</p>
    </a>
    <a class="en-card" href="/en/connectivity">
      <p class="en-card-label">Connect</p>
      <h2>Connectivity</h2>
      <p>Future English explainers for eSIM choices, setup, and reliable mobile data while abroad.</p>
    </a>
    <a class="en-card" href="/en/about">
      <p class="en-card-label">Know the site</p>
      <h2>About Comeback Traveler</h2>
      <p>Who publishes these notes, how the site is developing, and how to get in touch.</p>
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="en-note">
    <p><strong>English coverage is intentionally being built in stages.</strong> Existing Traditional Chinese articles remain available in their original URLs; this section will add English guides only when they can be properly maintained.</p>
  </div>
</EnglishPageLayout>
